  H^{(i,j,-)} &=& \{\beta \in \mathbb{R{p}\,|\, y_i - x_i^T \beta = (y_j - x_j^T \beta) \} = \{\beta \in \mathbb{R{p}\,|\, y_i - y_j = (x_i^T - x_j^T)\beta \} \\
