    Let $\beta \in H$ be a solution of system \eqref{eq:equations} of
    $q$ equations where $(\circ_1, \dots, \circ_q) \in \times_{i = 1}^q
    \{+,-\}$. Further, let us assume there exists no $i_{q+2}
